    <bpmn:process id="W_W5107" name="W5107. Field Organization Staffing, Span-of-Control &amp; Regional-Manager Workforce Planning" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual workforce plan (VS-103.3); territory re-alignment (W5106); growth ramp
Frequency: Annual + event-driven
Volume: ~6 regional + ~10–15 district managers + ops-standards/LP field staff (~44 field-management roles)
Owner: Director Field Retail Operations / HR (VS-103)
Participants: HR/TA (VS-121), Workforce Planning (VS-103.3), Store Ops (VS-07), FP&amp;A (VS-17.4), Total Rewards (VS-102)
Source: workflow W5107 — Field Organization Staffing, Span-of-Control &amp; Regional-Manager Workforce Planning</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5107_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5107_Lane1" name="HR">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5107_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5107_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5107_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5107_Lane2" name="Director Field Retail Operations">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5107_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5107_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5107_Start4" name="Annual workforce plan (VS-103.3); territory re-alignment (W5106); growth ramp">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5107_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5107_Task5" name="Forecast field-org demand: managers needed for 200 stores + 10–15 new-store/yr…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Forecast field-org demand: managers needed for 200 stores + 10–15 new-store/yr growth, attrition/backfill (15–20% industry turnover), and the supporting ops-standards/LP field complement
Responsible (R): HR / Director Field Retail Operations
Accountable (A): Director Field Retail Operations / VP Store Operations
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5107_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5107_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5107_Task6" name="Set the span-of-control &amp; structure: stores-per-manager, layers…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Set the span-of-control &amp; structure: stores-per-manager, layers (region/district/area), the ops-standards and LP field reporting lines, and succession bench depth
Responsible (R): Director Field Retail Operations / HR
Accountable (A): Director Field Retail Operations
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5107_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5107_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5107_Task7" name="Execute the talent supply plan: internal pipeline/succession (links VS-19.1)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Execute the talent supply plan: internal pipeline/succession (links VS-19.1), external recruitment (VS-121), and the budget with FP&amp;A/Total Rewards
Responsible (R): HR / TA / FP&amp;A / Total Rewards
Accountable (A): Director Field Retail Operations / VP Store Operations
Duration: Annual + ongoing</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5107_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W5107_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W5107_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W5107_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-102 (ensure field retail-standards execution.) | - CTL-761: workforce plan FP&amp;A-budgeted; span within policy; succession bench documented (VS-19.1)
Owner: Director Field Retail Operations / HR (VS-103)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
