    <bpmn:process id="W_W5108" name="W5108. Regional/District Manager Onboarding, Certification &amp; Capability Building" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: New manager hire/promotion (VS-121/VS-19.1); role-change; capability gap
Frequency: Per hire/promotion + ongoing
Volume: ~6–9 new/promoted field managers/yr (backfill + growth)
Owner: Director Field Retail Operations / L&amp;D (VS-19.4)
Participants: L&amp;D (VS-19.4), HR (VS-103), existing Regional Managers (mentor), LP (VS-23), Finance/HR for multi-store P&amp;L literacy
Source: workflow W5108 — Regional/District Manager Onboarding, Certification &amp; Capability Building</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5108_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5108_Lane1" name="L&amp;D">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5108_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5108_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5108_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5108_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5108_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5108_Start3" name="New manager hire/promotion (VS-121/VS-19.1); role-change; capability gap">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5108_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5108_Task4" name="Run the structured onboarding: field-ops orientation, the…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Run the structured onboarding: field-ops orientation, the store-visit/standards-audit method (W5114), the multi-store P&amp;L/grading model (W5109), systems training (field dashboard, W5127), and the decision-rights matrix
Responsible (R): L&amp;D / Director Field Retail Operations / Mentor
Accountable (A): Director Field Retail Operations
Duration: Per hire (4–8 weeks)</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5108_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
