      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5110_Task5" name="Plan field stabilization: assign a field sponsor, set the 30/60/90-day…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Plan field stabilization: assign a field sponsor, set the 30/60/90-day stabilization milestones (sales ramp, standards compliance, CX, shrink, staff retention), and the intensive visit cadence for the ramp period
Responsible (R): Director Field Retail Operations / Store Opening
Accountable (A): Director Field Retail Operations
Duration: Per opening</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5110_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5110_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5110_Task6" name="Execute stabilization support: intensive field visits, hands-on…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Execute stabilization support: intensive field visits, hands-on standards/merchandising help, staff coaching, escalation of issues to HQ support center (W5122), and weekly stabilization reporting
Responsible (R): Regional/District Manager / Director Field Retail Operations
Accountable (A): Director Field Retail Operations
Duration: 90-day ramp</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5110_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5110_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5110_Task7" name="Hand over to steady-state: maturity-ramp sign-off (meets steady-state KPIs)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Hand over to steady-state: maturity-ramp sign-off (meets steady-state KPIs), transition from intensive to standard cadence, and the post-stabilization lessons-learned
Responsible (R): Director Field Retail Operations / Store Ops
Accountable (A): Director Field Retail Operations / VP Store Operations
Duration: 90–180 days</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5110_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
