    <bpmn:process id="W_W5111" name="W5111. Underperforming/Distressed-Store Diagnosis &amp; Turnaround Program" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: D-tier grading (W5109); comp-sales decline; shrink spike; CX collapse; incident
Frequency: Per flagged store (typically ~5–15 active turnarounds)
Volume: ~5–15 turnaround engagements/yr
Owner: Director Field Retail Operations
Participants: Regional/District Manager, Store Manager (VS-07), FP&amp;A (VS-17.4), LP (VS-23), CX (VS-13), HR (VS-103/VS-84), Merchandising (VS-01)
Source: workflow W5111 — Underperforming/Distressed-Store Diagnosis &amp; Turnaround Program</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5111_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5111_Lane1" name="Regional">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5111_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5111_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5111_Lane2" name="Director Field Retail Operations">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5111_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5111_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5111_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5111_Start4" name="D-tier grading (W5109); comp-sales decline; shrink spike; CX collapse; incident">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5111_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5111_Task5" name="Diagnose root cause: structured diagnosis across sales/traffic/conversion…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Diagnose root cause: structured diagnosis across sales/traffic/conversion, merchandising/assortment, operations/standards, people/leadership, shrink/loss, CX, and local market/competition
Responsible (R): Regional/District Manager / Director Field Retail Operations / FP&amp;A
Accountable (A): Director Field Retail Operations
Duration: Per case (1–2 weeks)</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5111_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5111_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5111_Task6" name="Build the turnaround plan: 90-day action plan with owners, milestones, KPI…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Build the turnaround plan: 90-day action plan with owners, milestones, KPI targets, the resource asks (HQ support, capital, staffing), and the governance cadence
Responsible (R): Director Field Retail Operations / Store Manager / Functional Leads
Accountable (A): Director Field Retail Operations / VP Store Operations
Duration: Per case</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5111_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5111_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5111_Task7" name="Execute, monitor &amp; decide: intensive execution + weekly review, escalation of…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Execute, monitor &amp; decide: intensive execution + weekly review, escalation of blockers (W5122), and the continue/extend/close decision vs the closure option (VS-59)
Responsible (R): Director Field Retail Operations / Store Manager
Accountable (A): VP Store Operations
Duration: 90–180 days</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5111_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W5111_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W5111_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W5111_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-761 (ensure controlled execution — Field Organization, Territory Design &amp; Regional/District Store Management (PA-177.1).) | - CTL-761: structured diagnosis documented; turnaround plan leadership-approved; weekly governance; closure decision per VS-59 criteria
Owner: Director Field Retail Operations</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
