    <bpmn:process id="W_W5112" name="W5112. Field Compensation, Incentive &amp; Multi-Store Performance Recognition" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual comp cycle (VS-102); incentive plan design; recognition program
Frequency: Annual design + ongoing recognition
Volume: ~44 field-management roles + store-manager incentive linkage
Owner: Director Field Retail Operations / Total Rewards (VS-102)
Participants: Total Rewards (VS-102), FP&amp;A (VS-17.4), HR (VS-103), Store Ops (VS-07), Compliance (VS-118/VS-22)
Source: workflow W5112 — Field Compensation, Incentive &amp; Multi-Store Performance Recognition</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5112_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5112_Lane1" name="Total Rewards">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5112_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5112_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5112_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5112_Lane2" name="Director Field Retail Operations">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5112_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5112_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5112_Start4" name="Annual comp cycle (VS-102); incentive plan design; recognition program">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5112_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5112_Task5" name="Design field-leader incentive: the multi-store comp-sales / margin /…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Design field-leader incentive: the multi-store comp-sales / margin / standards-compliance / portfolio-P&amp;L incentive structure, the threshold/cap, and the integrity controls (no gaming of standards score)
Responsible (R): Total Rewards / Director Field Retail Operations / Compliance
Accountable (A): Director Field Retail Operations / Total Rewards Director
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5112_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5112_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5112_Task6" name="Administer &amp; pay: calculate payouts from verified performance data…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Administer &amp; pay: calculate payouts from verified performance data (W5109/W5114), approve, and process via payroll (VS-19.2)
Responsible (R): Total Rewards / FP&amp;A / Payroll
Accountable (A): Director Field Retail Operations / Total Rewards Director
Duration: Per cycle</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5112_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5112_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5112_Task7" name="Run recognition: top-performer recognition, the field-best-practice forum…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Run recognition: top-performer recognition, the field-best-practice forum (W5119), and the periodic non-monetary recognition
Responsible (R): Director Field Retail Operations / HR
Accountable (A): Director Field Retail Operations
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5112_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W5112_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W5112_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W5112_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-761 (ensure controlled execution — Field Organization, Territory Design &amp; Regional/District Store Management (PA-177.1).) | - CTL-761: incentive balanced multi-metric; standards score independently assured (VS-146); payout verified &amp; approved
Owner: Director Field Retail Operations / Total Rewards (VS-102)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
